<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Estimate Time to Charge a Battery</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01207</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Estimate Time to Charge a Battery</md:title>
    <md:uuid>54615230-79da-450f-aa0f-fe6a65aabb41</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para>
      <quote>For this project, think about an electronic device with a battery that you have to charge on a regular basis.</quote>
   </para>
    <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated">
  <item> What device is it?</item> 
  <item> When you are using the device, approximately how long does it take the battery to go from 100% charged until the time you need to plug it in again to recharge?</item> 
  <item> Approximately how long does it take to charge to 100% starting from 0% or nearly 0%?</item> 
  <item> Approximately how long does it take to charge if you plugged in your device when the battery was 50% charged?</item> 
  <item> How long do you think it would take to recharge the device to 100% from 50% compared to the time it would take if the device was at 0%? Would it be exactly half the time, more than half the time, or less than half the time it would take if starting from 0%?</item>
</list>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
